      ],
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "show 用到的 h1 还没有。新加的一行排在选中的那一行后面；要排到它前面，先删掉它再重写。",
          "en": "The h1 that show uses is not there yet. A new row goes after the row selected; to put one in front, remove that row and write it again."
